229
00:18:22,567 --> 00:18:24,194
I feel bad for her.

230
00:18:24,861 --> 00:18:26,071
It must be embarrassing.

231
00:18:44,256 --> 00:18:46,841
D.N.X FOREVER
WE WILL BE TOGETHER FOREVER

232
00:18:46,925 --> 00:18:49,261
{\an8}"DESTINY NEVER X,"
I KNOW I'LL SEE YOU ON STAGE AGAIN

233
00:18:54,558 --> 00:18:57,018
I can't believe you still had this.

234
00:18:58,061 --> 00:19:00,188
When I was going through
the toughest time after we disbanded

235
00:19:01,189 --> 00:19:03,316
this journal helped me stay strong.

236
00:19:08,905 --> 00:19:12,742
I didn't expect you
to hold this so dearly.

237
00:19:14,536 --> 00:19:17,831
During those toughest days,
I went and looked for these places.

238
00:19:22,002 --> 00:19:23,503
I thought I'd perhaps see you.

239
00:19:34,681 --> 00:19:36,016
D.N.X FOREVER
LET'S STAY TOGETHER FOREVER

240
00:19:38,226 --> 00:19:40,979
D.N.X FOREVER
LET'S STAY TOGETHER FOREVER

241
00:19:54,409 --> 00:19:55,535
<i>The person who continued</i>

242
00:19:56,494 --> 00:19:58,121
<i>to show me their support somewhere.</i>

243
00:20:02,334 --> 00:20:03,627
And now, we've finally met.

244
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:14,554
This is fascinating.

245
00:20:16,723 --> 00:20:19,392
I also spent
a lot of time sitting here

246
00:20:19,893 --> 00:20:21,603
listening to your songs

247
00:20:22,020 --> 00:20:23,772
just trying to get through life.

248
00:20:31,863 --> 00:20:32,864
We have

249
00:20:33,573 --> 00:20:36,117
always been supporting each other
from a distance, right?

250
00:20:39,913 --> 00:20:41,039
How about...

251
00:20:43,249 --> 00:20:44,459
we stay by each other's side

252
00:20:45,126 --> 00:20:46,544
from now on?

253
00:20:50,632 --> 00:20:51,633
Sorry?

254
00:20:56,346 --> 00:20:58,223
I want to start dating you.

255
00:20:58,848 --> 00:20:59,849
Da-reum.

256
00:21:03,728 --> 00:21:04,729
I want

257
00:21:06,189 --> 00:21:07,357
to get to know you more.

258
00:21:25,458 --> 00:21:26,960
I thought you were
hitting it off with the CEO.

259
00:21:27,043 --> 00:21:28,503
What's this plot twist?

260
